{"chapter": "etale-cohomology", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "06VW", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$(\\textit{Aff}/S)_\\tau$", "MATH_0002": "$(\\textit{Aff}/S)_\\tau$", "MATH_0003": "$S_{Zar}$", "MATH_0004": "$S_{affine, Zar}$", "MATH_0005": "$S_\\etale$", "MATH_0006": "$S_{affine, \\etale}$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{topologies-lemma-affine-big-site-Zariski}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{topologies-lemma-affine-big-site-etale}", "REF_0003": "\\ref{topologies-lemma-affine-big-site-smooth}", "REF_0004": "\\ref{topologies-lemma-affine-big-site-syntomic}", "REF_0005": "\\ref{topologies-lemma-affine-big-site-fppf}", "REF_0006": "\\ref{sites-lemma-criterion-points}", "REF_0007": "\\ref{theorem-exactness-stalks}", "REF_0008": "\\ref{topologies-lemma-alternative}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\medskip", "STRUCT_0002": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:aed7cec3a74d2199ef4cd0f0e751e87d02d4663faaac948d9d0e983194faaf74", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:3cf34fe6fbfafee015d81706f16c0553ab97ce6c3f83b3786cacc933d091411f", "source_text": "For each of the big sites the associated topos is equivalent to the\ntopos defined by the site <MATH_0001>, see\nTopologies, Lemmas <REF_0001>,\n<REF_0002>,\n<REF_0003>,\n<REF_0004>, and\n<REF_0005>.\nThe result for the sites <MATH_0002> follows immediately\nfrom Deligne's result\nSites, Lemma <REF_0006>.\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\nThe result for <MATH_0003> is clear. The result for <MATH_0004>\nfollows from Deligne's result. The result for <MATH_0005>\neither follows from (the proof of)\nTheorem <REF_0007>\nor from Topologies, Lemma <REF_0008>\nand Deligne's result applied to <MATH_0006>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:d0a882ddab269f49fdb67a79866f16337f2370a8ef5c7a0fc726de3e7ad37be0", "unit_id": "tag:06VX:proof"}
